export anchor Prompt_dba67eb4395cb3bd:
    userPrompt:
        \\\
        Let's revamp the styling of the @{ChatInputScope} to match this.  We still want to keep the chained mode and animations and all that, but overall let's change the styling to more follow this.
        \\\

    mode: code

    newConversation: true

    attachedImages:
        image1:
            \\\
            .suspense/images/1790677654-4f3479af05d9.png
            \\\

    systemPrompt:
        \\\
        We're working on the code located in ./src. Don't edit the spec located in ./spec.

        Before executing anything, read the spec it touches. Links to .claude/reference/... in the prompt are the spec for what they name. Read each one you need before changing anything it covers. Don't re-read something you've already read.

        Before changing anything, write the constraints this task must meet to ${UNDERSTANDING_FILE}, and keep it current as you read more of the spec. It is a Markdown list and nothing else: one line per constraint, at most twelve, each a single short, specific statement of what must be true, written as a link to the spec or reference file it comes from, such as `- [The chain tab has no bottom border in combined mode](spec/scope/prompt-mode/chat-input/index.pi)`. Only list what the spec says; leave out anything you are deciding yourself. Replace a constraint when you learn it was wrong rather than adding another.
        \\\

    references:
        - @{ChatInputScope}
- [Every colour is one of the theme's roles, in dark and light mode, never the chat input's own](.claude/reference/scope/prompt-mode/chat-input/index.md#theme)
- [Input on the left, send button on the right; the single row lines up with the send button](.claude/reference/scope/prompt-mode/chat-input/index.md#grow-to-fit)
- [The send button is a split button whose chevron opens the send menu above it, right edges aligned](.claude/reference/scope/prompt-mode/chat-input/index.md#split-button)
- [Send reads Queue while the harness works (not on Ask), Save while editing, and is disabled only while empty](.claude/reference/scope/prompt-mode/chat-input/index.md#description)
- [Queue is disabled on Ask; Preview and the menu aren't offered while editing a queued prompt](.claude/reference/scope/prompt-mode/chat-input/index.md#options)
- [Tabs Code, Chain, Spec, Ask, Freeform sit flush, no tab padded more than a normal tab](.claude/reference/scope/prompt-mode/chat-input/index.md#overview)
- [Chain is an icon tab that slides Code and Spec together when selected, with no line beneath it in combined mode](.claude/reference/scope/prompt-mode/chat-input/index.md#chain)
- [The selected tab and body are tinted the mode's colour, transitioning smoothly between tabs](.claude/reference/scope/prompt-mode/chat-input/index.md#colour)
- [The send button, both halves, is the selected mode's colour at full strength, text in the theme's solid-hue text colour](.claude/reference/scope/prompt-mode/chat-input/index.md#colour)
- [Help text, Slice, context, usage, and New conversation stay on the tab row, the help giving way to the rest](.claude/reference/scope/prompt-mode/chat-input/index.md#session)

